# Forest Dragon — an Intermediate enemy of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 5/12 Intermediate enemies — 18 life, bribe 80 gold
# enemy: Forest Dragon (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0049.dck "Forest Dragon (G, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink
#   3 file dated 2016-02-15; its first 12 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 12 lines (60
#   cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/forest_dragon.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 5)
#   [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/forest_dragon.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Intermediate) — "Forest Dragon"
#   (Original) [Tier-web — DIFFERS: main +{} -{}; side +{'Wall of Brambles': 1} -{}]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Forest Dragon
22 Forest
4 Craw Wurm
4 Cockatrice
4 Thicket Basilisk
3 Desert Twister
2 Stream of Life
4 Lure
2 Regeneration
4 Untamed Wilds
4 Llanowar Elves
3 Living Lands
2 Sandstorm
2 Wall of Brambles
1 Crumble
# The 1997 file's colour-keyed sideboard sections. The AI played the maindeck WITHOUT
# .vNone plus the one section matching the player's deck colour (.vNone by default);
# .vNone is folded into the maindeck above, and SB: holds, per name, the largest
# colour-section count minus the .vNone count — the smallest sideboard from which
# every 1997 configuration can be rebuilt by swapping.
#   .vNone   2 Wall of Brambles, 1 Crumble
#   .vBlack  3 Wall of Brambles
#   .vBlue   1 Wall of Brambles, 2 Giant Spider
#   .vGreen  1 Wall of Brambles, 2 Living Lands
#   .vRed    1 Wall of Brambles, 2 Stream of Life
#   .vWhite  3 Wall of Brambles
# (the wiki lists the sideboard as 2 Giant Spider, 2 Living Lands, 2 Stream of Life, 2 Wall of Brambles — same sections, a different fold)
SB: 1 Wall of Brambles
SB: 2 Giant Spider
SB: 2 Living Lands
SB: 2 Stream of Life
